From 053ad7098af88d0c3d87bc1a0d4c5ed1602398f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: crossainthero <billymillena@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:52:57 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] sarness: Sarness commands and user-facing text

- /cabinet runs the real 'sarness cabinet' (TUI suspended), /upgrade explains 'sarness upgrade',
  /connect explains that models come only from Sarness Engine; no cloud-provider onboarding
- terminal title, notifications, dialogs, crash screen, hints and resume commands say Sarness
